WEBVTT

00:05:57.895 --> 00:06:02.983
(Laughter)

00:06:03.025 --> 00:06:05.152
And they asked, "Will that be enough?"

00:06:05.194 --> 00:06:07.405
(Music)

00:06:07.446 --> 00:06:11.367
Because they didn't know
if that was enough.

00:06:11.409 --> 00:06:14.912
These are our nation's greatest minds.

00:06:14.912 --> 00:06:18.416
They are literally rocket scientists.

00:06:18.457 --> 00:06:24.922
They also tied the tampons together
by the strings like sausages.

00:06:25.256 --> 00:06:28.217
One hundred tampons.

00:06:28.634 --> 00:06:31.887
A hundred tampons.